OL,3,GNEWSAThree teens who died in car that
OL,4,Aentered river named
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys and a teenage girl who
OL,7,Fdied when a car they were in ended up
OL,8,Fin the River Wear have been named by
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FNorthumbria Police said a black Audi A3
OL,12,Fcame off the road at Panns Bank near
OL,13,FWearmouth Bridge, in Sunderland, and
OL,14,Fwent in the water just before 13:30 BST
OL,15,Fon Tuesday. Four people were in the car
OL,16,Fat the time.
OL,18,FThe three who died have been named as
OL,19,FJackson Duke, 17, Luke Etheridge and
OL,20,FZara Shaw, both 16.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
